cff-version: 1.2.0

message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both this archived software release
  and the associated PRISM manuscript.

title: >-
  PRISM: A Physics-Reality Integrated Signal Multistream Framework
  for Explainable Deepfake Detection Using Handcrafted Forensic Features

abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, frozen evaluation protocol, feature matrices,
  evaluation scripts and per-video results for PRISM-50, a 50-descriptor
  handcrafted forensic representation for video deepfake detection.
  The release includes the identity-disjoint FaceForensics++ split,
  frozen LightGBM configuration, preprocessing and operating-domain checks,
  and supporting material for reproducing the reported experimental results.

